{"sha": "e4bb29c5abc1aa80f133e3751f57f70f526bf67f6f9138766852e8941ebcc49c", "body": ["\\chapter{图形与立体图形}\\label{ch:g2:shapes}", "", "平面图形躺在纸上，立体图形则握在手中。本章", "按边数和角数给平面图形分类，用", "折过的纸角检验直角，并认识最初的立体图形——", "它们的面都是我们已经熟悉的平面图形。", "", "\\section{平面图形分类}", "", "\\begin{definition}[直边图形与圆形]\\label{def:g2:shapes:sort}", "边界只由直线段围成的图形称为", "\\emph{多边形}\\index{多边形}：三角形（$3$ 条边）、四边形（$4$ 条边：", "正方形和长方形都是四边形）、五边形（$5$ 条边）、", "六边形（$6$ 条边）。边界是曲线的图形，如圆，", "\\emph{不是}多边形。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!12] (0,0) -- (1.8,0) -- (0.9,1.5) -- cycle;", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0.9,-0.35) {$3$ 条边};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=3.2cm]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omThm!12] (0,0) rectangle (1.7,1.5);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0.85,-0.35) {$4$ 条边};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.6cm]", "  % pentagon sized to span the same height band (0..1.5) as its neighbors", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omMeth!12] (0.95,0.67) +(90:0.83) -- +(162:0.83) --", "    +(234:0.83) -- +(306:0.83) -- +(18:0.83) -- cycle;", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0.95,-0.35) {$5$ 条边};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=10.0cm]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omProp!12] (0.75,0.75) circle (0.75);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0.75,-0.35) {圆形};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 按边的条数分类。角的个数总", "等于边的条数。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[检验直角]\\label{met:g2:shapes:rightangle}", "将一张纸对折两次，得到一个尖角——这个角", "就是直角。把它放进图形的一个角里：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 如果图形的两条边恰好沿着折好的", "        角，这个角就是直角；", "  \\item 如果角更宽或更窄，它就不是直角。", "\\end{enumerate}", "正方形和长方形都有四个直角。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{在方格纸上复制图形}", "", "\\begin{method}[复制图形]\\label{met:g2:shapes:copy}", "在方格纸上，逐个顶点复制图形：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 选一个角，在空白方格纸上标出它；", "  \\item 数出到下一个角的方格数（“向右 $3$ 格，", "        向上 $2$ 格”），并标出这个点；", "  \\item 按顺序连接各个角，再与原图比较。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.5]", "  \\draw[gray!40] (0,0) grid (5,4);", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (1,1) -- (4,1) -- (4,3) -- (2,3) -- cycle;", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7cm]", "  \\draw[gray!40] (0,0) grid (5,4);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (1,1) -- (4,1) -- (4,3) -- (2,3) -- cycle;", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, omThm, below] at (2.5,-0.15) {复制图形};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 一个图形及其复制图，复制时数的是各角点", "之间的方格数。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{立体图形}", "", "\\begin{definition}[最初的立体图形]\\label{def:g2:shapes:solids}", "立体图形占据空间。它们的平面部分称为\\emph{面}\\index{面}：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{正方体}\\index{正方体}：$6$ 个正方形的面（像骰子）；", "  \\item \\emph{长方体}：$6$ 个长方形的面（像", "        麦片盒）；", "  \\item \\emph{圆柱}\\index{圆柱}：两个圆形的面和一个卷起来的侧面（像", "        罐头）；", "  \\item \\emph{球}：非常圆，没有平面的面。", "\\end{itemize}", "立体图形及其面在\\cref{ch:g5:solids}中再次出现。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.6]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (1.5,1.5);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,1.5) -- (0.6,2.1) -- (2.1,2.1) -- (1.5,1.5);", "  \\draw[thick] (2.1,2.1) -- (2.1,0.6) -- (1.5,0);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.0,-0.3) {正方体};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=4.0cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (2.4,1.2);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,1.2) -- (0.55,1.75) -- (2.95,1.75) -- (2.4,1.2);", "  \\draw[thick] (2.95,1.75) -- (2.95,0.55) -- (2.4,0);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.4,-0.3) {长方体};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.6cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0.3) ellipse (0.7 and 0.25);", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.7,0.3) -- (-0.7,1.9);", "  \\draw[thick] (0.7,0.3) -- (0.7,1.9);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,1.9) ellipse (0.7 and 0.25);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.3) {圆柱};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=11.8cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0.9) circle (0.9);", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,0.9) ellipse (0.9 and 0.3);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.3) {球};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}